	(text_box "USB-C: 5 V only (CC 5.1 k each: a C-C\ncable gets 5 V; an A-C cable from any 5\nV supply works).  1.3 A at most.  HRO\nTYPE-C-31-M-12: this part's CPL datum is\nknown from three boards." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.9700 100.3300 0) (size 40.6400 11.4300)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a03559db-e9ed-e7c0-2f49-a4ceda2952a6"))
	(text_box "2 A PTC, then a P-FET as an ideal diode\n(60 mOhm: 80 mV at 1.3 A; a Schottky's\n350 mV would put the ADL53xx under their\n4.75 V)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 72.3900 34.2900 0) (size 39.3700 10.1600)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7571a0b8-7c68-92c3-5c4f-d450b78e1078"))
	(text_box "Two ways to give the board its 5 V:\nthe USB-C jack (power only, no data;\nany 5 V supply) or, with JP301 HDR\n5V fitted, the PYNQ-Z2's 5 V on\nheader pins 2/4 when the PYNQ runs\non its barrel supply (not the Icepi\nZero's: no 1.4 A to spare).  Each\npath: a 2 A PTC and a P-FET ideal\ndiode.  Q302 turns off whenever\nUSB-C 5 V is present (VBUS lifts its\ngate); Q301 is off unless VBUS is\npresent (Q303 pulls its gate down,\n+5V_HDR holds it up): USB wins when\nboth are plugged and neither feeds\nthe other.  Power the PYNQ first\n(its clamps), then this board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.9700 125.7300 0) (size 34.2900 30.4800)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4dc24ca6-e404-39ec-cd60-84771a215aa1"))
	(text_box "C320: a cable's inductance and\nan all-ceramic input ring to\ntwice the supply on a hot\nplug.  This polymer's 0.1 ohm\nESR is about the ring's\nimpedance (0.5 uH of USB cable\nagainst the 22 uF pair), so it\ndamps it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130.8100 82.5500 0) (size 30.4800 16.5100)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e0816f3d-076d-088c-5aac-ca3c6ca31a38"))
	(text_box "+5V_RF: 5 V through the\nferrite, 828 mA (ADL5380 245,\nADL5375 203, 3 x ADL5611 372);\nthe PTC, FET and bead drop up\nto 215 mV at their maxima, so\n5.10 V at the plug leaves 4.89\nV (the ADL53xx and ADL5611\nwant 4.75): a bench supply at\n5.1-5.25 V, not a weak USB\nport" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 72.3900 157.4800 0) (size 30.4800 20.3200)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "287a6a1e-6608-ce46-5452-002f5eaa14fb"))
	(text_box "+5V_RF: the ADL5380 (245 mA), the\nADL5375 (203 mA) and the three\nADL5611 (124 mA each) through a 2\nA bead.  They need 4.75 V: the\nPTC, the FET and the bead at their\nmaximum resistances drop 215 mV,\nso 5.10 V at the plug leaves 4.89\nV (sim/budget.py section 9).  A\nbench supply at 5.1-5.25 V; a USB\nport must hold 5.01 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.9700 185.4200 0) (size 34.2900 20.3200)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "755249ae-6b9f-17a1-6140-a00dc6e354f7"))
	(text_box "+3V3_PLL_TX: 3.3 V,\n200 mA; 2.2 ohm ahead\nshares the heat" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.8400 46.9900 0) (size 22.8600 7.6200)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "85436c53-64ec-81f1-1bdf-a0a2e08dc10a"))
	(text_box "TPS7A2033, low-dropout linear\nregulator (LDO): 300 mA, 10 uVrms of\nnoise.  2.2 ohm ahead of it shares\nthe heat: 0.25 W in the LDO at 200\nmA (+47 C)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 181.6100 69.8500 0) (size 34.2900 11.4300)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "caadbb9b-6db5-59e8-d420-d569c9c5300f"))
	(text_box "The five regulators are linear (no\nswitching noise anywhere) and stand\nin one column on the board by the 5\nV entry; each rail fans out to chips\nall over the board, every one with\nits own capacitors at its pins, so\nthe distance costs a few mV of track\n(sim/budget.py section 9) and\nnothing in noise." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 265.4300 100.3300 0) (size 34.2900 17.7800)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ab26925a-64c5-f16a-34b1-de54e69230db"))
	(text_box "+3V3_PLL_RX: 3.3 V,\n200 mA; 2.2 ohm ahead\nshares the heat" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.8400 87.6300 0) (size 22.8600 7.6200)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7c35e3c7-922f-d39d-a7c4-a71d0ff842c2"))
	(text_box "+3V3_ANA: 3.3 V, 62 mA" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.8400 128.2700 0) (size 24.1300 5.0800)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fbd0c201-e10f-4e3d-621e-5ca74faee2b3"))
	(text_box "+3V3_ANA: the two FDAs, the loop op\namp, the LNA, the DSA, the TX bias\nreference: 40 mA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 181.6100 151.1300 0) (size 34.2900 7.6200)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0765ad5e-9290-3cca-a36e-d84e853037cf"))
	(text_box "+3V3_DIG: 3.3 V, 60 mA" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.8400 168.9100 0) (size 22.8600 5.0800)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4c99beb6-6193-f3a4-510c-1761d17b43ae"))
	(text_box "+3V3_DIG: comparators, switches,\nDAC, ADC, buffers: 30 mA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 181.6100 191.7700 0) (size 30.4800 6.3500)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "00c862f0-f804-920d-9ec4-b297e3b5acb7"))
	(text_box "+3V3_OSC: 3.3 V, 15 mA" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 243.8400 209.5500 0) (size 24.1300 5.0800)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c27424b1-c47d-15c7-ec75-df8c23b1ff49"))
	(text_box "LP5907, LDO: 6.5 uVrms for the VCXO\nand the TCXO (supply noise on an\noscillator is FM)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 181.6100 232.4100 0) (size 34.2900 7.6200)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5d6e5d96-40de-5c05-1764-2a84dcb6b008"))
	(text_box "Test pads: one per rail, and a\nground for the probe's clip.\nBelow: the same rails on U.FL\njacks through 1 k, for a\nlogger or a scope under\ncomputer control (Prompt 35);\na 50 ohm input reads them /21." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 185.4200 294.6400 0) (size 30.4800 15.2400)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "834e01a7-a823-e220-a525-86b959cb4d5d"))
	(text_box "5 V in: 1365 mA total (6.8 W); USB-C or the header, each\nthrough a 2 A PTC and an ideal diode" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 226.0600 264.1600 0) (size 52.0700 6.3500)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 214 236 255 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ce03d735-1e4d-ef3a-158d-fddf8d08f079"))
	(text_box "28 Zynq pins, LVCMOS33 through the PYNQ's own 200 ohm\nseries resistors (gen/pins.py is the one table: this\nsymbol, the silkscreen and gateware/pynq_z2.xdc come\nfrom it).  Odd pins are the PYNQ's outer row; pin 1 is\nat the right-hand end." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 367.0300 38.1000 0) (size 52.0700 11.4300)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9b7e3700-8c3e-f967-b510-4d7b603fb631"))
	(text_box "I2C pull-ups: JP302 (SDA)\nand JP303 (SCL) fitted = 4.7\nk to 3.3 V, for the Icepi\nZero (no pull-ups there);\nopen for the PYNQ-Z2 (2k2 on\nits header).  One bus, five\nparts, five distinct\naddresses: 0x0C AD5696R\n(sheet 7), 0x48 and 0x49\nADS1115 (sheets 3, 6), 0x60\nand 0x61 MCP4728 (sheets 3,\n6)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 547.3700 173.9900 0) (size 29.2100 22.8600)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9581d305-38dc-1f74-42f3-5a2ec5d891a7"))
	(text_box "100 k to ground: the latch enables and the trigger buffers'\ninputs rest low while no gateware drives the header (the\nhost off, unconfigured, or loading another overlay).\nTX_EN's own 1 k is on sheet 4." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 436.8800 173.9900 0) (size 52.0700 10.1600)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5c573f9e-cb33-148b-28e8-1d9d614f866e"))
	(text_box "Three M3 standoffs to the\ndesk (H301-H303) and one\nslot (H304) onto the\nPYNQ-Z2's top-right mounting\nhole, where the two boards\nregister through the 2x20\nheader." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 506.7300 219.7100 0) (size 29.2100 15.2400)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "530ec50c-e7be-abb2-3bbb-cbcef5c5fc8f"))
